 "source": "07853b05365275e3",
 "code": "def num_distinct(s: str, t: str) -> int:\n    n = len(t)\n    W = [0] * (n + 1)\n    W[0] = 1                                   # the empty target\n    for ch in s:\n        for j in range(n, 0, -1):              # downwards\n            if ch == t[j - 1]:\n                W[j] += W[j - 1]\n    return W[n]\n",
 "args": [
  "banana",
  "ban"
 ],
